/surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><source>Scientists and Scoundrels: A Book of Hoaxes</source><year>1965</year><publisher-name>New York, Thomas Y. Crowell</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Russell</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><source>Piltdown Man: The Secret Life of Charles Dawson and the World's Greatest Archaeological Hoax</source><year>2003</year><publisher-name>Gloucestershire: Tempus Publishing</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Archaeological Forgeries</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.sniggle.net/archforg.php"/></citation></ref><ref id="B19"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Lesson Plans Page</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.lessonplanspage.com/ScienceAnimalAdaptations58.htm"/></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kagan</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><source>Cooperative Learning</source><year>1995</year><publisher-name>San Clemente: Kagan Publishing</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Effective teaching</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.ltag.education.tas.gov.au/effectteach/Thinking/placemat.htm"/></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="book"><source>International Code of Zoological Nomenclature</source><year>1999</year><edition>Fourth</edition><publisher-name>London: The International Trust for Zoological Nomenclature</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Czerwinsky Domenis</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name></person-group><source>La discussione intelligente Una strategia didattica per la costruzione sociale della conoscenza</source><year>2000</year><publisher-name>Trento: Edizioni Centro Studi Erickson</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Morgan</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><source>The Acquatic Ape</source><year>1982</year><publisher-name>London: Penguin</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Roede</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Wind</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Patrick</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Reynolds</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name></person-group><source>The Aquatic Ape: Fact or Fiction</source><year>1991</year><publisher-name>London, Souvenir Press</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gould</surname><given-names>SY</given-names></name></person-group><source>Bully for Brontosaurus, reflections in natural history</source><year>1991</year><publisher-name>New York: W.W. Norton &#x00026; Company</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B27"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Fossilization and adaptation: activities in paleontology</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.ucmp.berkeley.edu/fosrec/Breithaupt2.html"/></citation></ref><ref id="B28"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>The International Council of Museums</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://icom.museum/young_act.html"/></citation></ref><ref id="B29"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wiggins</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Mc Tighe</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><source>Understanding by Design</source><year>2000</year><publisher-name>Upper Saddle River: Prentice Hall</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B30"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bruner</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><source>The Process of Education</source><year>1960</year><publisher-name>Cambridge, Mass.: Harvard University Press</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B31"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>Decreto Legislativo 19 febbraio 2004</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.pubblica.istruzione.it/normativa/2004/dec190204.shtml"/></citation></ref><ref id="B32"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Steiner</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><source>The Snouters; Form and Life of the Rhinogrades</source><year>1967</year><publisher-name>Garden City. Natural History Press</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B33"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Arter</surname><given-names>AJ</given-names></name><name><surname>McTighe</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><source>Scoring Rubrics in the Classroom: Using Performance Criteria for Assessing and Improving Student Performance (Experts in Assessment)</source><year>2001</year><publisher-name>Thousand Oaks, C: Corwin Press</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B34"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>ISEB Italian Society for Evolutionary Biology</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://web.unife.it/progetti/genetica/SIBE/index.htm"/></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>